            <ArticleTitle>[Clinical and rheovasographic correlations in patients with lumbosacral pain syndrome in the complex treatment using underwater vertical extension].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>49-51</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The article presents the findings of using underwater vertical extension in a complex treatment of patients with lumbosacral pain syndromes. The rheovasography method has been applied. Underwater vertical extension method in a complex treatment of patients with lumbosacral pain syndromes was found to be effective according to clinical data and positive dynamics of rheovasography's indices.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
